1990	Vienna (A)<p>
			"Management by Projects"<p>
1992	Florence (I)<p>
			"Project Management without Boundaries"<p>
1994	Oslo (N)<p>
			"Project Management - Dynamic Leadership<p>
			in a changing World"<p>
