<p>
The Research Projects</b><p>
<p>
<p>
New topics are developed and discussed in multi-national research groups.<p>
Such projects are:<p>
<ul><li> Project Financing<p>
<li> PM Training and Education in Europe<p>
<li> Strategic Value of Quality<p>
<li> European Certification Programme<p>
<li> Young Crew Project<p>
<li> Eastern European PM Programme<b><p>
</ul>
The Publications</b><p>
<p>
Since 1983 Butterworth Scientific Ltd. is publishing the International JOURNAL
or Project Management for the UK Association of Project Managers on behalf of
ITNERNET International Project Management Association. The International
Editorial Board of the Journal is appointed by INTERNET. The actual circulation
of the Journal is about 3500 copies.<p>
<p>
The INTERNET Newsletter reports twice yearly on the administrative and
technical activities of the association. It presents news from the national
societies and announcements of forthcoming events and conferences. The actual
circulation of the Newsletter is about 8000 copies.<b><p>
Your Membership</b><p>
Membership of the INTERNET International Project Management Associationis open
to all indivuals and organizations who are involved in project management and
who support the aims of the Association.<p>
<p>
INTERNET offers the following types of member-ship:<p>
<ul>
<li> Membership to a <u>National Organization</u>			<p>
<li> <u>Exclusive</u> membership to INTERNET<p>
<li> <u>Corporate</u> membership to INTENRET<p>
<li> <u>Indivudual</u> membership to INTERNET<p>
</ul>
<p>
Each type includes benefits and conditions of its own as well as the general
membership to the INTERNET family. Just write to the International Secretariat
which will send you the relevant information.<p>
